  data: {
    LLM: 'First to 121 or more points from tricks, last trick (10), and singing (20/40). No tute (four kings or horses) declaration.\n\nSame as Tute corriente except: eight cards each; turn one for trump, rest to stock. Non-dealer leads. While stock has cards: if trump is led you must play a trump (need not overtake); if non-trump led you may play any card. When stock is exhausted: follow suit, beat led card if possible, trump if void. After winning a trick you may sing one 40 or 20 (king-horse of same suit). Winner of trick draws first from stock, then opponent. First to 121+ wins.',
    Player: 'First to 121 or more points from tricks, last trick (10), and singing (20/40). No tute (four kings or horses) declaration.\n\nSame as Tute corriente except: eight cards each; turn one for trump, rest to stock. Non-dealer leads. While stock has cards: if trump is led you must play a trump (need not overtake); if non-trump led you may play any card. When stock is exhausted: follow suit, beat led card if possible, trump if void. After winning a trick you may sing one 40 or 20 (king-horse of same suit). Winner of trick draws first from stock, then opponent. First to 121+ wins.',
